I got up and went straight into the kitchen.
There I made myself a lunch.
I packed the food and my water bottle into the backpack.
Then I looked out of the window.
The sun shone really brightly.
So I left my thick winter boots in the closet.
I put on light shoes.
I wore them for the first time this year!
After that I looked for my sunglasses and found them.
Then I set off.
I left the flat and locked the door.
I went quickly down the stairs.
Outside a few people were already out and about.
Many neighbors went for a walk in the sun.
I walked on foot to the station.
The air smelled of spring.
I walked really fast.
I arrived at the station on time.
I looked forward to the trip so much, Sofia.
